  "notes": "{述|の}べる is an ichidan verb meaning to state, express, or describe formally. Used in speeches, writing, and formal contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧). Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{意見|いけん}→意見：01303_iken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{述|の}べる: to state an opinion\n- ⟦{感想|かんそう}→感想：00450_kansou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{述|の}べる: to express impressions\n- ⟦{結論|けつろん}→結論：02704_ketsuron⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{述|の}べる: to state a conclusion\n- ⟦{理由|りゆう}→理由：01102_riyuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{述|の}べる: to state the reason\n- ⟦{考|かんが}え→考え：00855_kangae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{述|の}べる: to express one's thoughts\n\nREGISTER:\nMore formal than ⟦{言|い}う→言う：00515_iu⟧ (to say). Common in academic writing, speeches, and official statements.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{陳述|ちんじゅつ}→陳述：08406_chinjutsu⟧: statement (noun form)",
